BT 1 0 0 1 0 128 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (This committee now has to review that framework for two reasons. The first is that the BNSS is not a pure) Tj T* (re-numbering. Besides carrying over most of the old preventive provisions it also adds new ones, the most) Tj T* (discussed of which is section 172, it also changes the structure within which police custody, remand and) Tj T* (arrest operate. Whether those changes strengthen or weaken constitutional safeguards is an open question.) Tj T* (The second and more empirical reason is how this was used in the National Capital Territory of Delhi during) Tj T* (the recent Anti-SIR protests. With prohibitory orders covering entire districts, detentions running into) Tj T* -0.120872 Tw (thousands, restrictions on public transport and the Supreme Court\001s repeated interventions in October 2026,) Tj T* 0 Tw (have turned what had been a more academic and theoretical discussion into something that is much more) Tj T* (applied.) Tj T* ET
