BT 1 0 0 1 0 66 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The trials of Indian National Army personnel also generated major protests in the final years of colonial rule.) Tj T* (In November 1945, student demonstrations in Calcutta brought together participants from different political) Tj T* (backgrounds. In February 1946, protests against the sentence imposed on INA officer Rashid Ali again united) Tj T* (students associated with otherwise competing organisations. Workers and other urban groups joined the) Tj T* (agitation, which involved serious confrontations with the authorities.) Tj T* ET
