BT 1 0 0 1 0 97 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Looking at more recent cases, the 2011 anti-corruption movement, led by Anna Hazare and India Against) Tj T* (Corruption, attracted substantial student and youth participation. Through online campaigning, young) Tj T* (people turned the demand for a Jan Lokpal into a National political issue. Such participation was also seen) Tj T* -0.056888 Tw (after the 2012 Nirbhaya case, where students joined women\001s organisations and other citizens in demanding) Tj T* 0 Tw (justice, safer public spaces and greater accountability for failures to prevent and respond to sexual violence.) Tj T* (In response, the government appointed the Justice J.S. Verma Committee, which submitted its report in) Tj T* (January 2013. This report amended Indian law, broadening sexual-offence provisions and introducing) Tj T* ET
