BT 1 0 0 1 0 143.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Students in India have also often come together to fight for themselves, opposing restrictions and) Tj T* (discrimination in universities. In 2014, students protested at Jadavpur University for adequate response to) Tj T* (an allegation of sexual harassment. Students increasingly demanded the resignation of Vice-Chancellor) Tj T* (Abhijit Chakrabarti, whom they held responsible for the action. In 2015, Pinjra Tod emerged in Delhi as) Tj T* -0.01625 Tw (women students challenged restrictive hostel rules. Its concerns included curfews, permission requirements,) Tj T* 0 Tw (limits on nights away and the unequal treatment of women\001s mobility. Students from various universities) Tj T* (came together to present issues that formed a broader pattern of female suppression. It also connected) Tj T* (hostel costs and shortages to the difficulties faced by students from disadvantaged backgrounds. Pinjra Tod) Tj T* -0.045916 Tw (holds a lot of significance as it broadened the meaning of student politics. It brought everyday discrimination) Tj T* 0 Tw (into issues discussed at mass levels.) Tj T* ET
