BT 1 0 0 1 0 50.5 Tm 15.5 TL 1 1 1 rg /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Article 21 provides that no person shall be deprived of life or personal liberty except according to procedure) Tj T* (established by law. Following ) Tj /F4+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Maneka Gandhi v. Union of India) Tj /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL ( \(1978\), the Supreme Court has interpreted) Tj T* (this requirement to mean that the procedure through which personal liberty is restricted must be fair, just) Tj T* (and reasonable, rather than arbitrary.) Tj T* ET
Q
