q
1 0 0 1 44 344.8898 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 66 Tm 15.5 TL 1 1 1 rg /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (This protection becomes particularly relevant when the regulation of an assembly involves detention, arrest,) Tj T* (removal of protesters or the use of force. In ) Tj /F4+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Joginder Kumar v. State of Uttar Pradesh) Tj /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL ( \(1994\), the Court held) Tj T* (that the existence of a power to arrest does not, by itself, justify its exercise in every case. In ) Tj /F4+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (D.K. Basu v.) Tj T* (State of West Bengal) Tj /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL ( \(1997\), it laid down safeguards concerning arrest and detention, including) Tj T* (requirements relating to arrest memos, informing a nominated person and medical examination.) Tj T* ET
