q
1 1 1 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 66 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The right to protest does not grant immunity from lawful arrest where an offence has been committed or) Tj T* (where statutory preventive powers are validly exercised. However, the presence of a person at a peaceful) Tj T* (assembly cannot, by itself, be treated as sufficient justification for arbitrary deprivation of liberty. The) Tj T* (legality of detention must be assessed independently of the legality of the restrictions imposed upon the) Tj T* (assembly.) Tj T* ET
