q
1 1 1 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 50.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Article 22 provides specific safeguards to persons who are arrested. These include the right to be informed) Tj T* (of the grounds of arrest, the right to consult and be defended by a legal practitioner of one's choice, and the) Tj T* (requirement that an arrested person be produced before the nearest magistrate within twenty-four hours,) Tj T* (excluding the time necessary for the journey.) Tj T* ET
Q
