BT 1 0 0 1 0 50.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (These protections are particularly significant in situations involving mass preventive action. Where large) Tj T* (numbers of individuals are detained during a protest, the authorities must still comply with the) Tj T* (constitutional requirements applicable to each detention. The scale of an assembly does not remove the) Tj T* (obligation to establish the legal basis for restricting an individual's liberty.) Tj T* ET
Q
