BT 1 0 0 1 0 35 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Article 22 also distinguishes ordinary arrest from preventive detention under a separate legal framework.) Tj T* (The constitutional safeguards applicable to the two forms of detention are not identical. Delegates should) Tj T* (therefore distinguish between arrest to prevent the commission of a cognisable offence under Section 170) Tj T* ET
