BT 1 0 0 1 0 93.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15 TL (The original Bill was introduced in the Lok Sabha in August 2023 and referred to the Standing Committee,) Tj T* (whose report was presented in November 2023. The government withdrew the original Bills and introduced) Tj T* (revised versions in December 2023. The revised Bills were passed during a session in which a large number) Tj T* (of opposition members had been suspended from the House, a fact on which opposition parties have relied) Tj T* (in questioning the depth of scrutiny. The government's position has been that the Bills were examined at) Tj T* (length by the Standing Committee and debated in the House. The committee need not resolve that dispute,) Tj T* (but members will find that it colours how each side talks about the Sanhita.) Tj T* ET
