BT 1 0 0 1 0 50.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Preventive restrictions in the past have relied on Section 144 of the Code of Criminal Procedure. Its current) Tj T* (counterpart, Section 163 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, permits urgent preventive orders) Tj T* (against dangers such as riots or threats to public safety. It requires a written order stating material facts) Tj T* (before the preventive action is put into place, ensuring anticipated disorder has a factual basis.) Tj T* ET
