1 0 0 1 44 449.8898 cm
q
1 1 1 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 128 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The 2011 Ramlila Maidan incident illustrates the limits of these powers. Police argued that permission) Tj T* (covered a yoga camp, rather than Baba Ramdev\001s anti-corruption protest, and cited crowd conditions and) Tj T* (security concerns. The Supreme Court examined both the justification for imposing Section 144 and how) Tj T* (police enforced it. It found no sufficient urgency to justify the midnight crackdown on sleeping participants) Tj T* (and criticised inadequate arrangements for safe dispersal. This shows that even where authorities have) Tj T* (grounds to regulate an assembly, the timing and degree of force require separate justification. A breach of) Tj T* (permission conditions does not itself establish an imminent threat. The main role of preventive powers is to) Tj T* (address a demonstrable danger and their enforcement must give participants a reasonable opportunity to) Tj T* (comply and avoid unnecessary injury.) Tj T* ET
