q
1 1 1 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 97 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Ahead of the February 2024 farmers\001 march, Delhi Police imposed month-long, citywide prohibitory orders,) Tj T* (citing anticipated violence, threats to property and road hazards from tractors. However, proportionality) Tj T* (requires examining whether the restriction extends beyond what the identified danger demands.) Tj T* (Tractor-related risks may justify vehicle controls without necessarily justifying restrictions on peaceful) Tj T* (assemblies throughout Delhi. In such instances, authorities were asked to explain why narrower measures,) Tj T* (such as agreed routes, traffic diversions or conditions on gatherings, would be insufficient. This was a test of) Tj T* (the orders\001 justification, rather than a claim that courts declared these particular orders unlawful.) Tj T* ET
