BT 1 0 0 1 0 35 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Conversely, in Amit Sahni v. Commissioner of Police \(2020\), concerning Shaheen Bagh, the Supreme Court) Tj T* (held that public ways could not be occupied indefinitely. Protecting commuters therefore has legal weight,) Tj T* (although this does not authorise every method of police intervention.) Tj T* ET
