BT 1 0 0 1 0 66 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (These directions were interim in nature and were issued while the Court considered the allegations and) Tj T* (sought further compliance reports from the concerned authorities. They should therefore not be treated as) Tj T* (a final determination that every restriction imposed during the protests was unconstitutional. The) Tj T* (proceedings nevertheless demonstrated the importance of judicial oversight where preventive measures) Tj T* (affect fundamental freedoms and essential public services.) Tj T* ET
