1 0 0 1 44 303.3898 cm
q
1 1 1 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 66 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The incident also raises questions concerning the institutional accountability of the Delhi Police. Since public) Tj T* (order and police fall within the Union's domain under Article 239AA, the elected Delhi Government does not) Tj T* (exercise direct control over the force responsible for regulating assemblies in the capital. The resulting) Tj T* (division of responsibility becomes particularly significant where the consequences of police action extend) Tj T* (across the city and affect both protesters and ordinary residents.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
