1 0 0 1 44 203.3898 cm
q
1 1 1 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 81.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The October 2026 protests therefore provide a contemporary illustration of the central tension within the) Tj T* (BNSS framework. Preventive powers may be necessary to address genuine and imminent threats to public) Tj T* (safety, but their exercise must remain grounded in material facts, limited to what the circumstances require) Tj T* -0.120853 Tw (and subject to meaningful judicial review. The question before Parliament is not whether public order should) Tj T* 0 Tw (be maintained, but how the law can ensure that its maintenance does not become a basis for imposing) Tj T* (restrictions broader than the threat itself.) Tj T* ET
